{"time": "20261117T172820Z", "think": "Quest done; give notes honestly.", "command": "answer 1. I took the thief seal-stone unseen from the Warden Vault at Blackrose. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka; the three stones open the Kings Gate so the Eye of Argonia can heal the sick Hist, and I must beat the Unbound to them. I now hold one stone. 2. Take the other two: the flooded vaults of Gemin (walk across the marsh from Jal-Veesa) and the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (near Noota Nara, by boat). Then take all three to the gate in Teku-Sul Spire. 3. I can do Gemin and Vorannuhl in either order. 4. I still do not know what moans in the cellar of Fort Chalkmoth, why Nesh-Deeka knows so much about the Unbound, or why Cuts-the-Old-Knot seals trees she drains. I could find out by following the hunt further.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn14.vault-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-m