{"time": "20261117T172824Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer Notes: I am a Reel-Ka of the Toh-Reel-Ka. I took the Blackrose seal-stone (Seal-Stone of the Kings) unseen: used the hall door, lifted the vault key from Okaz-Teel, opened the chest. I never spoke to gate-captain Corvus Ulvius and no alarm was raised. Ennodius Vanin the Collector is in the hall and wants the vault contents; he was left behind. I carry one stone. Still needed: Gemin flooded vaults (walk from Jal-Veesa across the marsh, rootworm) and Vorannuhl deepest hall (boat near Noota Nara). Then the three-socket gate in Teku-Sul Spire, off Lilmoth, which leads to the Root and the Eye. Open mysteries: the moaning thing in Fort Chalkmoth cellar (key not in the fort), Nesh-Deeka knowing too much about the Unbound, and why Cuts-the-Old-Knot seals the trees she drains.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn14.vault-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-ta